    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>It's easier when you're the one with the upper hand.</i></strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555710/extras/38c993e4d2a3c79fde69a44369e2c761.poster.avif?t=1696966322\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555710/extras/38c993e4d2a3c79fde69a44369e2c761.webm?t=1696966322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555710/extras/38c993e4d2a3c79fde69a44369e2c761.mp4?t=1696966322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Be a pest!</strong><br>In this arcade-inspired game, fulfill your desires and collect all the cheese in 80 designed levels to test your puzzle solving skills.<br><br><strong>Don't get caught!</strong><br>There's a specialized hunter with the sole purpose of hunting you down. Use your reflexes to avoid all their traps and turrets.<br><br><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master!</strong><br>With simple controls, it doesn't take long for you to understand how to play. But how you use it is another matter.",
